WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-reelshort-6ae152bbbf9d11c475011619 — Episode 13 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-26 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:06.220
Cal! Where are you going? We're not done talking!

2
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.620
We have nothing left to talk about.

3
00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:12.620
Dressed up this late? What, going to see another woman?

4
00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:15.220
Elara hasn't even agreed to the divorce yet. Why the rush?

5
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.620
You're just using the divorce as an excuse.

6
00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.420
You're going to see another woman, aren't you?

7
00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:21.620
You're not going anywhere until we clear this up!

8
00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:29.020
You ignore my calls? Now you threaten me with divorce?

9
00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:33.020
Cal, what do you want? You're just trying to force my hand, aren't you?

10
00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.620
Elara, you spoil him way too much.

11
00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:38.220
The more you cave, the further he pushes.

12
00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:41.420
Forget it. Reasoning with these people is a waste of time.

13
00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:45.820
Wait! Since when are you so petty? We used to be good!

14
00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:48.420
Are you really going to throw away this family over one damn gala?

15
00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:53.020
She says I've changed. She is right. I'm done with these seven years.

16
00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:59.220
Take the papers back. Come home with me. We'll pretend tonight never happened.

17
00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:01.420
You hear that? Elara's giving you a way out.

18
00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:04.220
Take the papers back and stop flattering yourself!

19
00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:09.820
Cal! I'm backing down! What else do you want?

20
00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:13.460
Next time, happy now?

21
00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:17.060
It's about basic respect, not your charity.

22
00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:21.860
You laid a hand on Elara? Are you insane?

23
00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:23.460
Look in the mirror, you loser!

24
00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:29.270
Who are you going to throw a fit over one dinner? I said I'll take you next time!

25
00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:34.070
Let him walk. We have Chase now. Our lives are only going to get better.

26
00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:37.070
Elara, don't be upset. You've still got me.
